flowchart TD
  I["1 Owner design intent expressed in the Chief chat"]
  C1["2 Chief records the requirement and prepares a concise proposed packet request - COS-CEO-N-nnn, READY_FOR_CEO_REVIEW"]
  H1["Owner hop - activate CEO chat"]
  C2["3 CEO validates priority and authority fit, checks conflict with existing directives and project authority"]
  ARCH["Architect review only if CEO detects a structural or authority conflict"]
  C3["CEO writes CEO-OPS-nnn to Delivery From-CEO, status OPEN"]
  H2["Owner hop - activate Delivery chat"]
  C4["4 Delivery verifies live state, duplicates, canonical destination and whether the packet is still appropriate - evidence order 1 to 4"]
  NR["NOT_READY / BLOCKED - destination or a required field ambiguous, no send-ready Owner task"]
  C5["5 store the final packet durably with stable ID and source pointers - VERIFIED / READY_FOR_OWNER_DELIVERY"]
  C6["Response-To CEO-OPS-nnn COMPLETE, READY_FOR_CHIEF_RENDERING, NEEDS_OWNER_PING 1"]
  H3["Owner hop - return to Chief with the DONE_EVENT"]
  C7["Chief renders one packet - platform plus exact chat name, and model plus effort for coding agents"]
  DEL{"Delegation evidence present - originating authority, stable ID, bounded scope, return or acceptance path"}
  BYP["ROUTING_STATE = BYPASS_SUSPECTED - block consequential writes, read-only evidence only, route back to canonical authority"]
  H4["6 Owner hop - send the validated packet once to the worker"]
  C8["SENT_EVENT bound - DELIVERED / DELEGATED_IN_FLIGHT, duplicates suppressed, No-Idle rescan"]
  W["worker executes bounded scope and writes durable recipient evidence - handoff, Status, Response-To"]
  H5["Owner hop - report completion, or Chief reads durable evidence on next activation"]
  C9["DONE_EVENT bound - reconcile Response-To, project and runtime evidence"]
  T["COMPLETED / RECONCILED - closure evidence preserved, lane leaves live set"]
  P["PARTIAL - remaining step inside packet scope, no new CEO or Delivery approval needed"]
  REP["Owner hop - in-scope remediation instruction, no new approval - OBSERVED PRACTICE"]
  NI["immediate No-Idle rescan - next stage becomes a new COS-CEO-N item, not a reuse of the terminal packet"]
  I --> C1
  C1 --> H1
  H1 --> C2
  C2 -->|"ACCEPT"| C3
  C2 -->|"conflict"| ARCH
  C2 -->|"MODIFY or BLOCK with minimum reason"| C1
  C3 --> H2
  H2 --> C4
  C4 -->|"ambiguous"| NR
  C4 -->|"clean"| C5
  C5 --> C6
  C6 --> H3
  H3 --> C7
  C7 --> DEL
  DEL -->|"yes"| H4
  DEL -->|"no"| BYP
  H4 --> C8
  C8 --> W
  W --> H5
  H5 --> C9
  C9 -->|"complete"| T
  C9 -->|"partial"| P
  P --> REP
  REP --> W
  T --> NI
